<title>SINGAPORE: MMI Holdings public offer 4.22 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>MMI Holdings public offer 4.22 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Disk drive components maker MMI Holdings Ltd said on Monday the public portion of its new share offer of 69.12 million shares was 4.22 times subscribed.  </p>
<p>The company had offered a total of 76.8 million shares at Singapore $0.52 each in its share offer.</p>
<p>Besides the public portion, the balance of 7.68 million shares were fully taken up by employees and business associates of the company.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
